        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://epic-pictures.com/film/all-the-lost-ones",
          "overview": "In a dystopian and climate-ravaged future America torn apart by civil war, a group hiding in a remote cabin become the target of a ruthless rebel militia leader and his platoon, viciously hunted in a fight for survival.",
          "runtime": 106,
          "tagline": "A climate-ravaged future American torn apart by civil war.",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Una guerra civile nel prossimo futuro sarà scatenata dalle misure imposte dal governo a causa del cambiamento climatico. Nia, sua sorella Penny e il suo fidanzato Ethan si stanno nascondendo quando un leader della milizia e i suoi seguaci arrivano alla loro porta.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "All the Lost Ones"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FI",
        "iso_639_1": "fi",
        "name": "suomi",
        "english_name": "Finnish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lähitulevaisuuden sisällissota syttyy hallituksen ilmastonmuutoksesta johtuvista toimenpiteistä. Nia, hänen siskonsa Penny ja poikaystävänsä Ethan piileskelevät, kun miliisijohtaja ja hänen seuraajansa saapuvat heidän ovelleen. (Owla)",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "RO",
        "iso_639_1": "ro",
        "name": "Română",
        "english_name": "Romanian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Un război civil dintr-un viitor apropiat este declanșat de măsurile impuse de guvern din cauza schimbărilor climatice. Nia, sora ei, Penny, și iubitul său, Ethan, se ascund, dar liniștea lor este întreruptă când un lider de miliție și adepții săi ajung la ușa lor.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IL",
        "iso_639_1": "he",
        "name": "עִבְרִית",
        "english_name": "Hebrew",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "באמריקה העתידית הדיסטופית והמוכת האקלים, שנקרעה לגזרים על ידי מלחמת אזרחים, קבוצה המסתתרת בבקתה מרוחקת הופכת למטרה של מנהיג מורדים אכזרי ומחלקתו.",
          "runtime": 106,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "כל האבודים"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "由于政府因气候变化实施的措施，引发了一场未来的内战。妮娅、她的妹妹佩妮以及她的男友伊森正在躲藏，这时一个民兵组织的领袖及其追随者来到了他们的家门口。",
          "runtime": 105,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "迷失之民"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "RU",
        "iso_639_1": "ru",
        "name": "Pусский",
        "english_name": "Russian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "В будущем из-за изменений климата разгорается гражданская война. Ниа, её сестра Пенни и парень Итан прячутся, но когда решают выйти за припасами, их встречает лидер ополчения и его последователи.",
